hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1713","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha: Allah key paas kaunsa gunaah sab se bada hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ye ke tum Allah key liye shareek banaao jabke us ne tumhey paida kya hai. Main ne kaha: Beshak wo bada hai. Main ne kaha: Phir kaunsa? Aap ne farmaya: Aur ye ke tum apni aulaad ko qatl karo is khauf se ke wo tumharey sath khaaeygi. Main ne kaha: Phir kaunsa? Aap ne farmaya: Ye ke tum apne padosi ki biwi se zina karo. (Bukhari: 4477). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur ham ne tum par baadal ka saaya kya aur tum par mann aur salwa utaara)."
"1714","[AI-translation] Saeed bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khumbi mann mein se hai aur uska paani aankh key liye shifa hai. (Bukhari: 4478). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur jab ham ne kaha: Is basti mein daakhil ho)."
"1715","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Bani Israel se kaha gaya: (Darwaazay mein sajda kartey huey daakhil ho aur kaho: Hitta). To wo apne sireenon par ghisat-tey huey daakhil huey. To unhon-ne badal diya aur kaha: Hitta baal mein daana hai. (Bukhari: 4479). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Ham jo aayat mansookh kartey hain ya bhulaatey hain us se behtar ya us jaisi ley aatey hain)."
"1716","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Hamaara sab se achha qaari Ubayy hai. Aur hamaara sab se achha qaazi Ali hai. Aur beshak ham Ubayy key qaul mein se chhortey hain. Aur wo isliye ke Ubayy kehta hai: Main kuchh nahi chhorta jo main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai. Jabke Allah Taala ne farmaya hai: (Ham jo aayat mansookh kartey hain ya bhulaatey hain us se behtar ya us jaisi ley aatey hain). (Bukhari: 4481). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur unhon-ne kaha: Allah ne beta banaaya hai, wo paak hai)."
"1717","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne farmaya: Aadam key betey ne mujhey jhutlaaya jabke usey wo nahi tha. Aur mujhey gaali di jabke usey wo nahi tha. Lekin uska mujhey jhutlaana to uska gumaan hai ke main use waisa wapas laaney par qaadir nahi hun jaisa wo tha. Aur uska mujhey gaali dena to uska qaul hai ke mera beta hai. To main paak hun is se ke biwi ya beta banaaun. (Bukhari: 4482). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur Maqaam-e-Ibrahim ko namaz ki jagah banaao)."
"1718","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Main Allah key teen mein mawafiq hua. Ya mera Rab teen mein mera mawafiq hua. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kaash tum Maqaam-e-Ibrahim ko namaz ki jagah banaao. Aur main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Tumharey paas nek aur faasiq daakhil hota hai, kaash tum Ummahaat-ul-Momineen ko Hijaab ka hukm do. To Allah ne Hijaab ki aayat naazil farmai. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur mujhey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka apni baaz biwiyon ko malaamat karna pahuncha. To main unkey paas daakhil hua aur main ne kaha: Agar tum baaz na aaein to Allah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko tum se behtar badal dega. Yahan tak ke main un mein se aik biwi key paas aaya. Us ne kaha: Ae Umar! Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mein apni auraton ko nasihat karney wala nahi hai yahan tak ke tum unhey nasihat kartey ho? To Allah ne naazil farmaya: (Shayed uska Rab agar wo tumhey talaaq dey to use tum se behtar biwiyaan badal dey jo Musalman hain) aayat. (Bukhari: 4483). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Kaho: Ham Allah par aur jo hamaari taraf naazil hua imaan laaey) aayat."
"1719","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Kitaab waley Tauraat ko Ibraani mein padhtey they aur use Arbi mein Islam walon key liye samjhaatey they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kitaab walon ko sacha na kaho aur na jhootha kaho. Aur kaho: (Ham Allah par aur jo hamaari taraf naazil hua imaan laaey) aayat. (Bukhari: 4485). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur aise hi ham ne tumhey darmiyaani ummat banaaya taake tum logon par gawaah ho) aayat."
"1720","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nuh ko Qiyaamat key din bulaaya jaaeyga. To wo kahega: Haaazir hun aur khushnaseeb hun ae merey Rab! To wo farmaaeyga: Kya tum ne pahunchaaya? To wo kahega: Haan. To uski ummat se kaha jaaeyga: Kya us ne tumhey pahunchaaya? To wo kahengey: Hamaarey paas daraaney wala nahi aaya. To wo farmaaeyga: Tumhaarey liye kaun gawahi deta hai? To wo kahega: Muhammad aur uski ummat. To tum gawahi dogey ke us ne pahunchaaya tha (Aur Rasool tum par gawaah hoga). To wo Allah key qaul (Aur aise hi ham ne tumhey darmiyaani ummat banaaya taake tum logon par gawaah ho aur Rasool tum par gawaah ho) hai. Aur darmiyaan: Insaaf wala. (Bukhari: 4487). Adi bin Haatim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha Ya Rasulullah: Safed dhaaga kaaley dhaagey se kya hai? Kya wo donon dhaagay hain? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tum chaudey gudi waley ho agar tum ne donon dhaagay dekhay. Phir farmaya: Nahi, balke wo raat ki siyaahi aur din ki safedi hai. (4510). Aap ne use farmaya jab us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main ne apne takiye key neechey do rassi rakkhen aur wo wazeh na huin. Aur aik riwayat mein hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tumhaara takiya bada hai agar safed dhaaga aur kaala dhaaga tumhaarey takiye key neechey hai. (4509). Aur Zabidi mein hai: Beshak wo raat ki siyaahi aur din ki safedi hai, sirf. Aur us mein (beshak tum) waghera nahi hai. Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Allah Taala ka qaul: (Phir wahaan se wapas aao jahaan se log wapas aaein)."
"1721","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Quraish aur jo unkey deen ki pairwi karta tha Muzdalifa mein thehartey they. Aur unhey Hums kaha jaata tha. Aur baaqi Arab Arafaat mein thehartey they. Phir jab Islam aaya to Allah ne apne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko hukm diya ke wo Arafaat mein aaein, phir us mein thehren, phir us mein se wapas aaein. (Bukhari: 4520). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur un mein se koi kehta hai: Ae hamaarey Rab! Hamein duniya mein bhalai dey) aayat."
"1722","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmaatey they: Ae Allah! (Ae hamaarey Rab! Hamein duniya mein bhalai dey aur aakhirat mein bhalai dey aur hamein aag key azaab se bacha). (Bukhari: 4522). Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khandaq key din farmaya: Unhon-ne hamein darmiyaani namaz se rok diya yahan tak ke sooraj ghurub ho gaya. Allah unki qabron aur unkey gharon, ya unkey peton, Yahya ko shak hua, ko aag se bhar dey. (4533). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Allah Taala ka qaul: (Wo logon se chipat kar nahi maangtey)."
"1723","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Miskeen wo nahi hai jise khajoor aur do khajoorein aur luqma aur do luqmaey wapas kartey hain. Beshak miskeen wo hai jo paakdaaman rehta hai. Aur padho agar chaaaho, yaani uska qaul (wo logon se chipat kar nahi maangtey). (Bukhari: 4539). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Us mein mohkam aayatein hain jo Kitaab ki jad hain aur doosri mutashaabeh hain)."
